                        We recommend reviewing the privacy policies of
                        third-party service providers.
                    </p>

                </section>


                <section class="content-section" id="account">

                    <h2>09. No Account or Sign-In Required</h2>

                    <p>
                        SlidePrint does not require users to create an
                        account or sign in to use the App.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        There is currently no user registration, password
                        system, or developer-managed user account associated
                        with SlidePrint.
                    </p>

                </section>


                <section class="content-section" id="sharing">

                    <h2>10. Data Sharing</h2>

                    <p>
                        Kushagra Innovations does not sell or rent your
                        personal information.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        SlidePrint does not upload your PDF documents or
                        their contents to a developer-controlled server.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Information processed by third-party services such
                        as Google AdMob may be handled by those providers
                        according to their own privacy policies and
                        applicable laws.
                    </p>

                </section>


                <section class="content-section" id="backup">

                    <h2>11. Data Backup</h2>

                    <p>
                        SlidePrint may be included in Android's device
                        backup mechanisms depending on your Android device,
                        operating-system settings, and the App's backup
                        configuration.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Any Android backup is managed by Android/Google
                        and is associated with your device/account environment.
                        Kushagra Innovations does not receive or directly
                        control your personal Google Drive backup.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        You can manage Android backup settings through your
                        device's Android/Google account settings.
                    </p>

                </section>


                <section class="content-section" id="retention">

                    <h2>12. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>

                    <p>
                        Because SlidePrint primarily stores its application
                        data locally on your device, you can manage or remove
                        this information through the App or Android system
                        settings.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        You may delete your processing history using the
                        <strong>Clear All History</strong> option available
                        in the App, where applicable.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        You may also delete locally stored application data
                        by uninstalling SlidePrint or clearing the App's
                        storage through Android settings.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Deleting the App or clearing its storage may remove
                        locally stored history, settings, and other
                        application data.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Third-party services such as Google AdMob may retain
                        information according to their own policies and
                        retention practices.
                    </p>

                </section>


                <section class="content-section" id="security">

                    <h2>13. Data Security</h2>

                    <p>
                        We take reasonable measures to design SlidePrint so
                        that user documents and application data are processed
                        locally where possible.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        However, no method of electronic storage or
                        transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        SlidePrint does not intentionally transmit your PDF
                        documents or their contents to Kushagra Innovations'
                        servers.
                    </p>

                </section>


                <section class="content-section" id="children">

                    <h2>14. Children's Privacy</h2>

