                        <li>Clearing application history</li>
                        <li>Clearing application storage</li>
                        <li>Uninstalling the App</li>
                        <li>Managing advertising and privacy settings available through your Android device and Google services</li>
                    </ul>

                </section>


                <section class="content-section" id="changes">

